<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody>Encyclopedia Practitioner: Provisioning
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading1>Part I: Foundations
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading1>Chapter 1: Using This Book
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>About This Book
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>What You Will Find
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>What You Will Not Find
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000E>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Reading an Item Entry
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarHeading>Sample Entry
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Longsword<CharStyle:> <0x2014> <CharStyle:Italic>Heavy one-handed blade, 36" to 44" length<CharStyle:>
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>{{CoreMetadata
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Damage: Heavy
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Weight: 4 lbs · Bulk: 2
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Cost: 90 gp
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Traits: Versatile, Balanced
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Variants: Arming sword, bastard sword
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody>A balanced cut-and-thrust blade suitable for foot or mounted combat. Its length rewards reach without sacrificing control; its cross-guard gives the Balanced trait and a small parry advantage when used two-handed.
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
