<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Currency and Pricing
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarHeading>Scaling Note <0x2014> Example
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody>Low-coin economies commonly price a longsword at 15 gp rather than 90 gp. If your table uses a low-coin baseline, divide all prices in this book by six.
