<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading1>Part II: Arms & Armor
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading1>Chapter 4: Armor & Shields
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>The Basics
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Reading an Armor Entry
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000E>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>The Piecemeal System (Optional)
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading3>Hit Location Rolls
