<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading1>Chapter 7: Ranged Weapons
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>The Logic of Range
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Range Bands and Rates of Fire
