<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading3>Brewing Economics
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Intoxication
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Level
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Effect
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Slight
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Moderate Willpower penalty to resist temptation. No physical effect.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Moderate
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Slight Agility penalty; Slight Perception penalty. Socially louder.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Major
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Moderate Agility penalty; Moderate Perception penalty. Combat-relevant impairment.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Severe
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Major penalties to all physical rolls; speech impairment; risk of unconsciousness.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Critical
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Unconscious. Possible alcohol poisoning (Endurance check at Demanding difficulty).
<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000E>
