<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Rescaling Prices
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>One-Page Summary
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarHeading>Quick Reference <0x2014> Everything You Actually Need
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Damage:<CharStyle:> Glancing / Solid / Heavy / Crushing / Devastating
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Protection:<CharStyle:> Minimal / Light / Medium / Heavy / Extreme
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Difficulty:<CharStyle:> Trivial / Routine / Challenging / Demanding / Near-Impossible
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Modifier:<CharStyle:> Slight / Moderate / Major / Severe
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Abilities:<CharStyle:> Strength / Agility / Endurance / Intelligence / Willpower / Presence
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Style A<CharStyle:> = armor-buffer rules; use big dice and Durability pools.
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Style B<CharStyle:> = armor-class rules; use small dice and AC values.
<ParaStyle:Sidebars:SidebarBody><CharStyle:Bold>Style C<CharStyle:> = armor-points rules; use small dice and subtractive AP.
