<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Skirmish Aftermath
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Roll
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Result
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1<0x2013>20
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Nothing useful. Blood-soaked rags, broken gear.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>21<0x2013>40
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1d10 cp, common clothing in Damaged condition.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>41<0x2013>55
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1d6 sp, a belt pouch with flint & steel, a small knife.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>56<0x2013>70
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>A working weapon (roll Weapon Type table) in Serviceable condition.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>71<0x2013>80
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Light armor (leather/hide/gambeson) in Serviceable condition.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>81<0x2013>88
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>A shield (any type) in Damaged condition.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>89<0x2013>93
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1d6 gp, a personal item (ring, medallion, letter).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>94<0x2013>97
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>A moderately valuable piece (weapon worth 100+ gp, or a quality item).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>98<0x2013>99
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Something unusual (roll on Curiosity table or GM improvises).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>100
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Unique: a named item, a sealed letter, a hidden document.
