<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Alive and healthy. A rouncey or palfrey.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>71<0x2013>85
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Alive and healthy. A courser.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>86<0x2013>95
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Alive and healthy. A war-trained horse.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>96<0x2013>98
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Destrier (still skittish; needs handler).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>99<0x2013>100
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Destrier with intact barding.
