<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Roll
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Result
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1<0x2013>20
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Nothing useful <0x2014> already scavenged.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>21<0x2013>40
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Food stores: 3d6 person-days of rations (Damaged, partially spoiled).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>41<0x2013>55
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Weapons rack: 1d4 assorted polearms or swords, Serviceable.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>56<0x2013>65
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Armor store: 1d3 complete sets of light/medium armor.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>66<0x2013>75
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Siege engine intact (roll Ch 12 table) <0x2014> Damaged but repairable.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>76<0x2013>83
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>War chest: 1d6 × 50 gp in mixed coin.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>84<0x2013>90
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Stables with 1d4 unclaimed horses.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>91<0x2013>95
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Armory with masterwork weapon (roll Ch 5 table).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>96<0x2013>98
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Officer's quarters: personal kit (masterwork weapon, quality armor, 100<0x2013>500 gp, journal or letters).
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>99
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Hidden cache: 1,000<0x2013>5,000 gp in silver/gold/jewels.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>100
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Unique: a relic, a sealed document of political import, a legendary artifact.
