<ParaStyle:Body Text:CoreBody><0x000C>
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Availability Rolls
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Roll
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Result
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>1
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>In stock now. Full price.
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>2
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Sold out, but the shop has one on order; 1-2 weeks
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>3
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Not in town; one of the neighboring towns has it; 2-4 weeks or travel
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>4
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Would have to be made / commissioned; see crafting (Ch 3)
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>5
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Not available without connections; GM determines
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>6
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Can be found through a collector or black market; premium price (Moderate or Major cost bonus)
<ParaStyle:Headings:Heading2>Price Variance by Region
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Region Type
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Cost Modifier
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_HEADER>Notes
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Frontier / poor
