<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL><0x2212>Slight
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Goods flow through; competition
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Monopoly town (guild-controlled)
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>+Moderate
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Guild-mandated prices
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Enchanter's enclave
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL><0x2212>Moderate (enchanted); +Slight (mundane)
<ParaStyle:Table:TABLE_CELL>Abundant magic, scarce mundane
